@startuml
title UC0 - Hello Agent - CLI Ask Flow

actor User
participant "UC0 CLI" as CLI
participant "Workflow (UC0)" as WF
participant "LLM Wrapper (UC0)" as LLM
participant "OpenAI API" as OpenAI

User -> CLI : enter message
CLI -> WF : add_user_and_respond(history, user_input)
WF -> LLM : chat_completion_uc0(messages)
LLM -> OpenAI : chat.completions(...)
OpenAI --> LLM : response
LLM --> WF : reply text
WF --> CLI : updated history
CLI --> User : display reply

@enduml
